    "body": "> LGTM with nits. I agree that we probably should unify the behavior between `requestDevice()` and the Permissions API integration. Of course the latter is a bit aspirational since it isn't implemented in any browser engine.\r\n\r\nThank you! I've addressed your nits.\r\n\r\nWould it be okay to land this as is and file a spec issue to unify the behaviour between `requestDevice()` and the Permissions API? ",
